        <activityName xml:lang="en">Process-specific burdens, residual material landfill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Process-specific burdens, residual material landfill
inorganic landfill for polluted inorganic wastes like with carbon content below 5%;
UUID: 89a4ae2f-2679-47a7-90b3-834244ba3384
process-specific (i.e. independent of waste composition) energy demand and land use of landfill
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: landfill with base seal, leachate collection system. Renaturation after closure.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: data from one literature source on sanitary landfill, adapted to features of this landfill type 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_89a4ae2f-2679-47a7-90b3-834244ba3384.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
